      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Andrey, I just read your doc after replying here. Somehow I think what Pierre-Clément implemented here doesn\u0027t correspond to the Option 1 you described in the doc, which suggests starting with a hash check and bypassing all existing verification steps (potentially even omitting vbmeta signing?). Let\u0027s continue the discussion in the doc.",
