      "writtenOn": "2025-01-29T21:24:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "yeah would be great to have some algo id for digest algos used here, as I\u0027m pretty sure we\u0027ll want crypto agility down the road (sha-3 or at least -384/512), but I see it\u0027s hard-coded for all digests (kernel, initrd) in VerifiedBootData. so a fix is wider than vbmeta_digest",
